### Self-Loop Rule Invalidation Repro
### Case: Instance start -> manual transition -> target state has 1 auto (target $self) + 2 manual transitions.
### Auto transition's onExecutionTask also targets self -> rule invalidated -> state does NOT loop 2nd time.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = self-loop-repro-workflow
@instanceKey = self-loop-repro-{{$timestamp}}

### Step 1: Start workflow instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "{{instanceKey}}",
  "tags": ["self-loop-repro", "repro"],
  "attributes": {}
}

### Step 2: Get current state (should be "entry-state")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state
Accept: application/json

### Step 3: Execute manual transition (entry-state -> loop-state)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/go-to-loop
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Step 4: Get state after manual transition
### Expected: "loop-state". Auto transition (target $self) runs once; onExecutionTask makes rule invalid -> no 2nd loop.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state
Accept: application/json

### Step 5: Get instance data (verify self-loop task ran once)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/data
Accept: application/json

### Step 6a: Proceed (manual) -> completed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/proceed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Step 6b: Or cancel (manual) -> cancelled
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/cancel
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {}

### Step 7: Final state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state
Accept: application/json
